<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 69 0 R
/E (Students with project ideas often cannot pursue them alone, and those who learn new skills rarely find opportunities to apply them. A student with Python knowledge might want to build a machine learning traffic prediction prototype but lack a teammate for the UI. Meanwhile, a student with React experience has no way to discover projects needing front-end help. Informal channels exist but have three key limitations:)
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [1]
>>
endobj
